From 03a6d05ade6673bd5fa2b7eaecc0a23af4f9c35f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 20:58:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): setup eye in the browser; only the active setup is
 drawn by default

Each setup row gets the browser eye. A setup other than the active one has
its operation paths, work-offset triad and fixtures undrawn until its eye is
turned on, which never activates it. View state only (like the other eyes):
posting, simulation and collision checks are untouched.

Fixes #1494

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
